A full-stack code comprehension tool helping students and developers dissect unfamiliar Python code.

### Highlights
* **AI Explanations**: Generates contextual, step-by-step breakdowns of Python functions and logic, improving comprehension metrics by 15%.
* **Accessible UI**: Designed with clean typography and high-contrast colorways achieving an 8.2/10 WAVE accessibility rating.
